{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120420","id":3895056428,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7oKdgs","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120420","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120420.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120420.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120420","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120420/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120420/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120420/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0080774364e07064f61f61fbeb4b64913e2922e8","number":120420,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add 'Auto Unfold' and 'Collapse All' functionality to EditorInspector","user":{"login":"Shaderd00d","id":9315812,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMTU4MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9315812?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d","html_url":"https://github.com/Shaderd00d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nThis PR addresses the need to reduce repetitive clicking when editing multiple nodes of the same type (e.g., mass-editing Transform properties of MeshInstance3D nodes). It allows users to automatically unfold specific property sections (like \"Transform\") when switching nodes. It's an attempt to address these proposals:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/499\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3676\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9589\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13781\r\n\r\n### Features:\r\n- Added two new toggle options in the inspector section context menu:\r\n  - Auto Unfold for Nodes of the Same Class\r\n  - Auto Unfold for Nodes of Any Class\r\n- Added a 'Collapse Section on All Nodes' option.\r\n- Introduced two new icons to indicate if a section was unfolded automatically: <img width=\"12\" height=\"12\" alt=\"GuiTreeTwoArrowsDown\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/158bcc59-a20c-4c1c-97bf-96e51cb3fc7e\" /> <img width=\"12\" height=\"12\" alt=\"GuiTreeThreeArrowsDown\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db46ba9f-3a89-4e8c-b5ad-63d8147efcc0\" />\r\n- The features are scoped to Node objects and remain hidden in the Remote Scene Tree to prevent cluttering non-local node contexts.\r\n- Settings are stored in EditorSettings (hidden).\r\n\r\nThis video should give you an idea of how it works (sorry for the bad quality). \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cd0b30c-89e3-4cf1-ade2-c47fd51188a6\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color"